       270-LOOP-SIMULATE-ORDER-LINE.                                    DXB24111
           MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-SAVE-QTY-SHIPPED.          DXB24111
           PERFORM 1220-GN-ORSLNE.                                      DXB24111
                                                                        DXB24111
           IF NOT WS-ORSLNE-NORESP  OR                                  DXB24111
              ORL-VOIDED-LINE       OR                                  DXB24111
              ORL-COMMENT-TYPE                                          DXB24111
              GO TO 270-EXIT.                                           DXB24111
                                                                        DXB24111
